      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "A road suitable for automobiles reached Camp Nelson in 1922, and by the mid‑1960s it was upgraded to all‑year access.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25,
